 solvers are interchangeable behind it 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Families:
 linear programs (LP),
 mixed-integer programs (MIP),
 constraint programming (CP),
 local search 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Classic uses:
 airline crews,
 supply chains,
 scheduling,
 network design,
 and vehicle routing 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Most routing problems are NP-hard;
 practical instances are solved by good heuristics with a time limit,
 not by proofs of optimality 
\end_layout

