\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\size small
The model never routes or optimizes; it sees no coordinates and no store names 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\size small
The start is the phone's GPS position 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\size small
Every result is re-checked against the final route 
